    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8050" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cĭnĕrĕus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		cinis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>similar to ashes</i>, <i>ash-colored</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 2, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Scrib. 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin.
				37, 10, 68, § 183 sq.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					35, 16, 54, § 192</span></i>
			 uva, <i><span class="en">id. 14, 3, 4, §
			42</span></i>.—Hence, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cĭnĕrĕum</span></b> ,
